    "detailed_description": "CUCKOLD SIMULATOR, the exciting new game where you play as Cuckold (that is his name) in his day-to-day life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Work your job at GloboCorp to make money<br></li><li> You can give all your hard-earned money to the bull<br></li><li> Browse your favorite websites, such as Reddit\u2122<br></li><li> Your fat wife will verbally abuse you<br></li><li> Become emotionally attached to children that are not biologically yours<br></li><li> Collect 'Funky Pop' collectibles that are hidden across the world<br></li><li> Play actual games on your 'Wintendo Snitch' gaming console, such as 'Cuck Souls'<br></li><li> And more!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1141550/extras/ddb7231fc9d46b2f247f7cfad7ca691e.avif?t=1723864390\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One Happy Family</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cuckold</strong> - Husband and beta male provider of the family. Only good for providing income. <br></li><li> <strong>Wife</strong> - Fat and mean. Only has eyes for Tyrone - and Cuckold's wallet.<br></li><li> <strong>Tyrone</strong> - Transient alpha male of the household. Has outstanding warrants.<br></li><li> <strong>DeShawn</strong> - Wife's ten year old child from a previous relationship. Does not respect Cuckold.<br></li><li> <strong>Tyrone Jr.</strong> - The newest addition to the family. Named after his father. Too young to not respect Cuckold.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wintendo Snitch</h2><br>The Wintendo Snitch is a fully functional game console that you can purchase inside of the game. Play exciting games such as <strong>CUCK SOULS</strong> or Anime Girl Genocide. Truly a treat for fans of the soulsborne genre. More games to be released eventually.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati